Title:  Version 19.5.0

Seq:    13.1

Level:  3 - chapter

Class:  version

Timestamp: 20260802162652

Body:

##### New Note Link Field Type

Added a [[Note Link]] field type to allow something like a wiki link, but confined to a single field, instead of appearing within a string of Markdown text.

##### New Redirect Field Label

Added a [[Redirect]] field label that can be used to generate a page that simply redirects a web browser from the *redirect* location to the primary location.

##### Links to Favicon Files Now Generated

When using the [[Export as Web Book]] function to export a web book as a site, Notenik will now check the output folder for the presence of one or more [Favicon](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Favicon) files and then, if found, will generate the appropriate HTML [link](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Favicon) elements to ensure that browsers find and use the favicon files. 
